Package: rete
Title: Query Local and Remote 'rete' RDF Graph Files with SPARQL
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Carlos", "Vivar Rios", , "carlos.vivarrios@epfl.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Client for the 'rete' single-file RDF graph format: open a
    local file or an http(s) URL and run SPARQL queries against it,
    getting data frames back. Remote files are read lazily over HTTP
    range requests, fetching only the byte ranges a query touches — a
    multi-gigabyte graph on plain object storage stays interactive with
    no database server. Files can carry their own dataset card and
    example queries, and small graphs can be built directly from RDF
    text. See <https://caviri.github.io/rete/> for the format.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/caviri/rete, https://caviri.github.io/rete/
BugReports: https://github.com/caviri/rete/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
